      "question": "Bsc optometry me admission ke liye kya karna hoga Hindi medium",
      "answer": "King George's Medical University (KGMU) mein B.Sc. Optometry mein admission ke liye, aapko kuch steps follow karne honge:\n\n1.  **Eligibility Criteria:** Sabse pehle, aapko KGMU ki official website par B.Sc. Optometry course ke liye eligibility criteria check karna chahiye. Ismein aam taur par 12th pass hona zaroori hai, jismein science stream (Physics, Chemistry, Biology) mein achhe marks hon. Admission ke liye koi specific percentage requirement bhi ho sakti hai.\n\n2.  **Application Form:** Jab admission process start hota hai, toh aapko KGMU ki official website se admission form fill karna hoga. Ye online ho sakta hai.\n\n3.  **Entrance Examination:** KGMU mein B.Sc. Optometry mein admission ke liye ek entrance exam hota hai. Is exam ke liye aapko taiyari karni hogi. Exam ka syllabus KGMU ki website par mil jayega.\n\n4.  **Counselling aur Admission:** Entrance exam mein aapke performance ke basis par, aapko counselling ke liye bulaya ja sakta hai. Counselling ke dauran aapko document verification aur seat allotment ki prakriya se guzarna hoga.\n\n**Important Links:**\n\n*   **KGMU Official Website:** [https://www.kgmu.org/](https://www.kgmu.org/)\n*   **Paramedical Courses:** Aapko KGMU ki website par \"Paramedical Courses\" section mein aur adhik jaankari mil sakti hai. Yahan se aap admission process aur eligibility criteria ke baare mein pata kar sakte hain.\n\nAdmission se related latest updates ke liye KGMU ki official website par regular check karte rahein. Agar aapke koi aur sawaal hain toh pooch sakte hain.",
